  "text": "תושבי 저희.Translate into Chinese and\n<style=\"border-right:1px solid #fff\">\n<style=\"border-right:1px solid #fff; border-bottom:1px solid #fff\">\n<style=\"border-right:1px solid #fff; border-bottom:1px solid #fff; border-left:1px solid #fff\">\n<style=\"border-right:1px solid #fff; border-bottom:1px solid #fff; border-left:1px solid #fff; border-top:1px solid #fff\">\n\n<style=\"border-right:1px solid #fff; border-bottom:1px solid #fff; border-left:1px solid #fff; border-top:1px solid #fff; background-color:#CCCCE3\">\n\n<style=\"border-right:1px solid #fff; border-bottom:1px solid #fff; border-left:1px solid #fff; border-top:1px solid #fff; background-color:#333333\">\n\n<style=\"border-right:1px solid #fff; border-bottom:1px solid #fff; border-left:1px solid #fff; border-top:1px solid #fff; background-color:#black\">\n\n<style=\"border-right:1px solid #fff; border-bottom:1px solid #fff; border-left:1px solid #fff; border-top:1px solid #fff;\"\n\n<style=\" border-bottom: 1px solid #fff; \"\n<style=\"border-right: 1px solid #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #fff; \"\n<style=\"border-right: 1px solid #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #fff;  border-left: 1px solid #fff;\"\n<style=\"border-right:1px solid #fff\"; \"\n<style=\"border-right:1px solid #fff; border-bottom:1px solid #fff;\"\nWe are ܥש פרוידס'א\nWe are ܥשלים'א\n\n悠久传承的教师不仅仅限于70余年的岁月积淀，更在于永不落幕的三尺讲台。从“匠心精神”的锤炼到“新课标”的观摩，从“教师集体备课会”的深度探讨，“公开课”中的教学展示，再到“研修班”上关于课程与备课、教材的深化学习，我们教师团队不断追求。\n谈及自己来自哪里、怎样成为教师；不同年龄阶段的“成长之路”出发点、痛点和变化；从业期间的喜悦和心灵独白；对于新师的期望和帮助；对于学校、单位甚至特级教师的祝愿；对于“精研细琢”的想法，教导主任和本校教师共同分享经验，共同见证学校历史发展的珍贵画面。无论是把握“大手笔”、开创“新气象”，还是寻找“真教育”、彰显“最美姿”，每一位教师的成长都在为学校发展贡献力量。\n“匠心是一种职业精神，更是一种教育信仰。”回首过往，教师如春风化雨，润物无声；展望未来，教师将继续秉持“三尺讲台，志以天下”信念，用智慧与坚守书写教育新篇章。我们的教师团队不仅充满活力，更有坚定的信心，相信未来我们将为教育事业和学校发展付出更多努力，播下更多希望的种子，换得更加茁壮的成长。（提炼主要内容）\n\nThe content primarily discusses the enduring legacy and dedication of teachers, emphasizing their passion for education and continuous professional growth. Here is the summary:\n\n1. **Teacher Legacy**:\n   - Teachers have 70+ years of experience but also highlight the importance of the teaching profession.\n   - They are honored for their unwavering commitment to staying on the 3rd tier of the academic pyramid.\n\n2. **Professional Pursuits**:\n   - Site-specific courses, transformation courses, and research-and-mindedness courses.\n\n3. **My Journey as a Teacher**:\n   - Origins, learning path, successes, and future goals.\n\n4. **Support for Younger or Less Experienced Teachers**:\n   - Continuous encouragement and ideals.\n\n5. **Acknowledgment to Leadership and Colleagues**:\n   - Impatience with just form, falling short of greatness.\n\n6. **Personal Advice for New Teachers**:\n   - Discounts on bureaucratic deals.\n\n7. **Future Confidences and Reimagination**:\n   - Stories of making innovation and reforms essentially meaningful, and feeling the desire to create a unique culture.\n\n8. **Motivations and Image**:\n   - Goals for building a concern-oriented school culture.\n\n9. **Original Purpose**:\n   - 3rd tier meaning, facing challenges and achieving greatness.\n\n10. **Basic Thoughts on Becoming a Professional or Great Teacher**:\n    - Learning from confidant teachers, self-reflection, experience sharing, discoveries, and continuous improvement.\n\nThe overall theme is a celebration of teachers' dedication, influence, and evolving role in education, emphasizing the importance of spirit and overcoming challenges through immeasurable efforts.",
